{
  "title": "Lightly Braised French Chicken Blanquette",
  "description": "A classic French dish featuring chicken, vegetables, and a creamy sauce, perfect for a weeknight dinner. This recipe is sugar-free friendly and made with a soffritto base and cilantro leaves.",
